# RS_VRBody -- the mirror panel. A flat quad wearing the RSMIRROR camera texture.
#
# MODEL FILE ORDER IS (x, z, y): the loader swizzles, so file y becomes world Z
# (up) and file z becomes world Y (across). Authored here as x=0, y = height,
# z = width, which lands as an upright panel facing world +X.
#
# BOTH WINDINGS ARE EMITTED, four triangles for two visible sides. A one-sided
# quad that happens to face away is INVISIBLE, and "I see nothing" is the one
# result that cannot be told apart from "it is broken". Two sides costs two
# triangles and removes that failure entirely.
#
# 64 wide, 96 tall, centred on the actor's origin.
v 0 -48 -32
v 0 -48  32
v 0  48  32
v 0  48 -32
vt 0 1
vt 1 1
vt 1 0
vt 0 0
vn  1 0 0
vn -1 0 0
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1
f 1/1/1 3/3/1 4/4/1
f 1/1/2 3/3/2 2/2/2
f 1/1/2 4/4/2 3/3/2
